UPDATE companies SET description='Foodservice Equipment Agents (F.E.A.) was founded in 1996 in Placentia, California, as a manufacturer''s representative for foodservice equipment across California and Nevada. The company operates as an independent sales agency representing multiple equipment brands.

F.E.A. provides manufacturer representation, equipment demonstrations through demo kitchens in Southern California, Northern California, and Las Vegas, and coordinates delivery, installation, warehousing, and distribution through its sister company F.E.A. Service, LLC, which was established in 2016. The service division employs factory-trained, NATE- and EPA Universal-certified technicians who perform authorized repairs using OEM parts for brands such as Continental Refrigerator, Crown Verity, Electro Freeze, Federal Industries, Henkelman, Hestan Commercial, Irinox, Moffat, Pizza Master, and Robot Coupe.

The company serves the foodservice and commercial kitchen industries, supplying equipment to restaurants, hotels, and institutional foodservice operators in California and Nevada. Its represented product lines include Prática high-speed ovens, Hestan grills, Dry Ager aging cabinets, and Mibrasa charcoal ovens, among others.

F.E.A. states its mission is to be the food equipment manufacturer representative in its territory, emphasizing excellence, innovation, and long-term partnerships with both manufacturers and customers.', certifications=ARRAY['NATE','EPA Universal']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Manufacturer representation", "Equipment demonstration", "Delivery and installation", "Warehousing and distribution", "Factory-authorized service and repair", "OEM parts supply"], "industries": ["Foodservice", "Commercial kitchen"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Pr\u00e1tica High Speed Ovens", "Hestan Grills", "Dry Ager", "Mibrasa", "Continental Refrigerator", "Crown Verity", "Electro Freeze", "Federal Industries", "Henkelman", "Hestan Commercial", "Irinox", "Moffat", "Pizza Master", "Robot Coupe"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Factory-trained technicians using OEM parts", "NATE and EPA Universal certified service team", "Demo kitchens in three locations across California and Nevada", "Manufacturer''s representative for California and Nevada markets", "Delivery, installation, warehousing, and distribution services"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1996 -> db", "Headquarters Placentia, California -> db", "Manufacturer''s representative for California and Nevada -> /", "Sister company F.E.A. Service started in 2016 -> /", "NATE and EPA Universal certifications -> /", "Factory-trained technicians using OEM parts -> /", "Demo kitchens in Southern California, Northern California, Las Vegas -> /about", "Represents brands: Pr\u00e1tica, Hestan, Dry Ager, Mibrasa, Continental Refrigerator, Crown Verity, Electro Freeze, Federal Industries, Henkelman, Hestan Commercial, Irinox, Moffat, Pizza Master, Robot Coupe -> /", "Services: delivery, installation, warehousing, distribution -> /", "Mission: premier food equipment manufacturer representative -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "F.E.A. represents the industr