UPDATE companies SET description='Franklin Sheet Metal operates from Franklin, Massachusetts, where it was established in 1953. The company ranks among the oldest metal fabricators in New England and became part of the Potentia Manufacturing Group in 2020, gaining ITAR registration that underscores its compliance posture.

