UPDATE companies SET description='The company provides vertically integrated services across 12 manufacturing sites and two sales offices worldwide, encompassing 813,000 square feet of production space and a workforce of over 2,700. Core capabilities include silicone molding and extrusion, thermoplastic injection molding and extrusion, precision metal tubing and hypotube fabrication, specialty needle manufacturing, hydrophilic and drug-eluting coatings, and complex catheter design and assembly. The organization supports programs from rapid prototyping through high-volume production.

