UPDATE companies SET description='Furniture Industries, based in Minneapolis, Minnesota, traces its roots to 1952 when it began as a furniture manufacturing and reupholstery operation. The business transitioned to a third-generation family enterprise under Arnie Labofsky, who took leadership in the mid-1970s and instilled a culture of “do right by your clients and team members” that still guides the company.

