UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1996, GK Foods Inc. has built over 30 years of expertise in contract manufacturing and co-packing of dry food products from its San Marcos, California location. The company operates as a co-manufacturing partner for brands seeking flexible packaging solutions.

