UPDATE companies SET description='GLW, formerly Great Lakes Woodworking, was founded in 1984 in Detroit, Michigan, when carpenters Mike Mancinelli and Paul LaCroix left their separate jobs to start a business together in a garage. Eventual owner Tony Gatliff later joined the partnership, helping the company expand beyond its humble beginnings.

