UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1982 in Lisle, Illinois, Gator Chef is a family-owned, women-led business that has served the commercial foodservice market for over four decades. The company began as a restaurant supply store just outside Chicago and has grown into a full-service provider of kitchen equipment, design, and support.

Beyond product sales, the company offers commercial kitchen design and build services, equipment leasing and renting, CFPM certification training, and custom cutting board fabrication. Its showroom and warehouse in Lisle support both walk-in customers and project-based orders.

The customer base spans independent restaurants, pizzerias, sandwich shops, cafes, food trucks, and institutional kitchens. Gator Chef also maintains a dedicated focus on K-12 school foodservice, working with directors and facility managers to design compliant, efficient cafeteria operations. Hospitality and bakery segments are served through specialized equipment lines such as curved glass display cases and combi ovens.

