ress: 4770 Route 212, Kintnersville, PA 18930 -> /", "Business hours Monday-Thursday 8:00 AM - 4:00 PM -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "custom woodworking manufacturing facility", "founded_year": "1991", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='glenn-a-hissim-woodworking' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Global CNC Machine Services was founded in 2014 in Moraine, Ohio. The company began as a field-service operation focused on repairing and maintaining CNC and manual machine tools, sending certified technicians to customer sites across the United States and abroad.

Today the firm provides a full range of machine-tool services: on-site mechanical and electrical troubleshooting, scheduled preventative maintenance, machine relocation and installation, turnkey project management, ball-bar testing for accuracy certification, equipment inspections and appraisals, spindle and linear-guide repair, and sourcing of used machines and parts. Technicians travel nationally and internationally, with documented work as far as Japan.

The customer base consists of manufacturers and facilities that operate CNC machinery, including those running Mazak equipment.

