UPDATE companies SET description='Go-Devil Manufacturing-Louisiana was founded in 1977 in Baton Rouge, Louisiana. The company began by developing longtail engines capable of navigating shallow, vegetation-choked waters, earning a reputation among duck hunters and commercial fishermen across North America.

Today the company produces a range of marine propulsion systems and watercraft, including longtail and surface-drive engines, aluminum-hull boats built for duck hunting and surface-drive applications, floating blinds, weedless propellers, and a line of accessories such as fuel tanks, push poles, and camouflage seats. It also assembles a duck picker for game processing. Operations are conducted in a 40,000-square-foot high-tech facility where over 30 full-time staff handle design, in-house fabrication of nearly all components, assembly, and a full parts inventory for aftermarket support.

The primary customers are outdoor enthusiasts—duck hunters, sport anglers, and commercial fishermen—who operate in extreme shallow-water environments such as cypress swamps, mud trenches, and rock-laden rivers.

Go-Devil emphasizes that its products are designed and tested in the harshest conditions the company can find, and that its in-house manufacturing and comprehensive parts stock enable customer service that it describes as second to none. The firm traces its differentiation to decades of field testing and the ability to supply replacement parts for every engine it has built.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Engine manufacturing (longtail and surface drive)", "Boat manufacturing (duck hunting and surface drive hulls)", "Propeller manufacturing", "Floating blind fabrication", "Duck picker assembly", "Accessory manufacturing", "In-house parts fabrication", "Sales and service"], "industries": ["Marine", "Outdoor recreation", "Hunting", "Commercial fishing", "Sport fishing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house manufacturing of nearly all components", "Full inventory of replacement parts for all engines", "Over 40,000 sq ft high-tech production facility", "Over 30 full-time employees", "Products designed and tested in extreme shallow-water conditions"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1977 -> db", "Headquarters Baton Rouge, Louisiana -> db", "Employee count over 30 -> /services", "Facility size over 40,000 sq ft -> /services", "In-house manufacturing of nearly all parts -> /services", "Full inventory of replacement parts -> /services", "Product lines: longtail engines, surface drive engines, boats, floating blinds, propellers, accessories, duck picker -> /", "Industries served: duck hunters, sport and commercial fishermen -> /", "Company type manufacturer -> /services", "No ownership tags stated -> db", "No certifications stated -> db", "No equipment named -> db", "No materials listed -> db", "No volume, lead time, tolerances stated -> db", "No cage code, min order, export compliance, languages, social links -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_