UPDATE companies SET description='Gold Medal Products Co. – Indianapolis has operated from Noblesville, Indiana since 1993, when it began as the region’s dedicated concession equipment and supplies provider. The branch is managed by Michael Knotts and serves a territory stretching from Indianapolis to Fort Wayne, Evansville, Louisville, Terre Haute, Bloomington, South Bend, Mishawaka, and Elkhart.

