ities to control energy future -> /about-us", "Niche: home micro-grids -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We design, develop and install complete solar panel PV systems for residential and commercial installations throughout Colorado.", "founded_year": "2006", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='golden-solar' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
