UPDATE companies SET description='The shop produces custom, handmade furniture and home decor exclusively from premium hardwoods such as walnut, sapele, mahogany, cherry, maple, and white oak, milled in-house. Finishes range from Rubio Monocoat hard wax oil and Tung oil to custom blends, Arm-R-Seal, conversion varnish, milk paint, and wood stains from General Finishes. Each project follows a structured process: client inspiration leads to a CAD design drawing, a 50 % deposit secures a first-in-first-out build slot, and lead times typically run 8–10 weeks.

Customers are primarily residential clients looking to replicate or adapt pieces seen in catalogs from Wayfair, West Elm, or Restoration Hardware, or on platforms like Pinterest, Instagram, and Etsy. Recent commissions include dining and coffee tables, chairs, benches, and specialty items such as a bourbon cabinet built from a reclaimed barrel with mahogany shelves and LED lighting.

Wayne’s direct involvement ensures that no pine or construction‑grade lumber enters the shop, and the finish process includes up to three stain samples cut from the project’s own off‑cuts so clients can verify color in their own lighting. The company positions itself on quality over quantity, emphasizing materials and craftsmanship that exceed mass‑produced imports.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture design", "Handmade furniture construction", "In-house wood milling", "Wood finishing (oil, varnish, paint, stain)", "CAD design drawing generation", "Stain color sampling from off-cuts", "First-in-first-out project scheduling", "Home decor fabrication"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Home decor", "Custom woodworking"], "materials": ["Walnut", "Sapele", "Mahogany", "Cherry", "Maple", "White Oak", "General Finishes stains", "Rubio Monocoat hard wax oil", "Tung oil", "Arm-R-Seal", "Conversion varnish", "Milk paint", "Wood stain & topcoat"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "8-10 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Owner-craftsman personally oversees every build", "Premium hardwoods only; no pine or construction-grade lumber", "Custom finishes including Rubio Monocoat hard wax oil", "CAD design drawings with customer sign-off before build", "Stain samples cut from project off-cuts for color accuracy"], "facts_used": ["Company located in Leesburg, Virginia -> db", "Owner and lead craftsman is Wayne -> /", "Small business with owner as lead craftsman -> /, /about-us", "Name derived from old Army nickname -> /, /about-us", "Specializes in custom handmade furniture from premium hardwoods -> description, /services", "Hardwoods used: walnut, sapele, mahogany, cherry, maple, white oak -> /, /services", "Finishes: General Finishes, Rubio Monocoat, Tung oil, custom blends, Arm-R-Seal, conversion varnish, milk paint, wood stain & topcoat -> /services", "Lead times typically 8-10 weeks -> /services", "Process: inspi