UPDATE companies SET description='Grain Designs operates near Fargo, North Dakota. The company was founded in 2013 by architectural designers who began building furniture in a two-stall garage in Fargo.

The studio designs and manufactures custom office and residential furniture, including reception desks, office desks, conference tables, live-edge tables, dining tables, and podcast and media desks. Pieces are crafted from solid hardwoods using a combination of design consultation, custom drafting, and in-house woodworking. From its garage origins, the operation has expanded to a design-and-build studio at a location called The Pines, and the company reports having assisted over 100 businesses with office spaces.

Grain Designs serves commercial office clients, residential customers, and media-production environments. Named projects include work for NorthStar Financial (conference tables, sit-stand desks, shelving), Enclave Companies'' flagship office (meeting tables, conference table, shelving), and a "You Betcha!" build (office desks, podcast table, container bar). The company also works directly with homeowners on custom residential pieces.

The company emphasizes a "Custom without Compromise" approach, offering custom-designed hardwood desks and tables at prices comparable to or lower than mass-produced commercial office furniture, with a typical build time of as little as six weeks and a commitment to on-time, on-budget delivery. Its "Character Driven" philosophy centers on building relationships rather than mass production, and all furniture is made in North Dakota without imported components.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture design", "Custom furniture manufacturing", "Woodworking", "Solid hardwood fabrication", "Finish application", "Design drawings", "Free design consultation", "Project quoting"], "industries": ["Commercial office", "Residential", "Media and podcast", "Architectural builds"], "materials": ["Solid hardwoods"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "As little as 6 weeks for custom furniture", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom hardwood desks and tables priced at or below commercial office furniture", "Build time as short as six weeks with on-time, on-budget delivery", "Furniture made in North Dakota using solid hardwoods, no imported mass-produced pieces", "Free design consultation and custom finish options", "Relationship-focused, character-driven approach rather than mass production"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2013 -> /", "Headquarters near Fargo, ND -> /", "Founded by architectural designers -> /", "Started in two-stall garage -> /", "Custom office and residential furniture -> /", "Products: reception desks, office desks, conference tables, live edge tables, dining tables, podcast & media desks -> /", "Solid hardwood materials -> /", "Over 100 businesses served -> /", "Projects: NorthStar Financial, Enclave Companies, You Betcha! -> /", "Custom without Compromise: same price or less than competitors, 6-week build -> /", "Character Driven: relationships not mass production -> /", "North Dakota Made: no imported mass-produced