UPDATE companies SET description='Great Blue Heron Furniture operates from Manchaca, Texas, where it was founded in 1991.

The shop offers a made-to-order design service that guides clients through material selection and configuration for single pieces or whole-home projects. Its product range includes armchairs, ottomans, dining tables, sofas, recliners, and specialty items such as hand-carved storage trunks and hacienda-style tables. A ready-to-ship sample program runs alongside the custom line. Current lead time for upholstered pieces runs seven to nine weeks.

