UPDATE companies SET description='Great Divide Fabrication LLC, operating as Great Divide Services, is based in Buffalo, Wyoming. The company was launched in 2018 by Erik Burden, a master mechanical technician who began his career as an apprentice and advanced to journeyman and manager before starting the business.

The company provides heating, ventilation, air conditioning, and gas piping services for residential and commercial customers. Its offerings include installation of furnaces, heat pumps, infrared garage heaters, split systems, ductless mini-splits, and rooftop units. It also performs custom sheet metal fabrication and decorative tin work, and sells metal, piping, and related supplies. The shop operates with 24-hour emergency service availability.

Great Divide serves homeowners and businesses in Buffalo and surrounding Wyoming communities. Its residential clients rely on the company for furnace and air-conditioning installation, annual maintenance, and emergency repairs. Commercial customers include those needing package units and rooftop systems.

